{"name":"Heat Signature","hex":"#e3000e","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"heat","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Thermal energy.","Heating system; a system that raises the temperature of a room or building."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To cause an increase in temperature of (an object or space); to cause to become hot .","To become hotter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/heat"},{"term":"signature","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person's name, written by that person, used as identification or to signify approval of accompanying material, such as a legal contract.","An act of signing one's name; an act of producing a signature."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Distinctive, characteristic, indicative of identity."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/signature"}],"entries":[{"title":"Infrared signature","blocks":[{"text":"Infrared signature, as used by defense scientists and the military, is the appearance of objects to infrared sensors. An infrared signature depends on many factors, including the shape and size of the object, temperature, and emissivity, reflection of external sources from the object's surface, the background against which it is viewed and the waveband of the detecting sensor. As such there is no all-encompassing definition of infrared signature nor any trivial means of measuring it. For example, the infrared signature of a truck viewed against a field will vary significantly with changing weather, time of day and engine loading."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infrared_signature"},{"title":"Adventure Time season 2","blocks":[{"text":"The second season of Adventure Time, an American animated television series created by Pendleton Ward, premiered on Cartoon Network on October 11, 2010, and concluded on May 2, 2011. The season follows the adventures of Finn, a human boy, and his best friend and adoptive brother Jake, a dog with magical powers to change shape and size at will. Finn and Jake live in the post-apocalyptic Land of Ooo, where they interact with the other main characters of the show: Princess Bubblegum, The Ice King, Marceline the Vampire Queen, Lumpy Space Princess, and BMO."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/53/Adventure_Time_Season_2_cover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adventure_Time_season_2"},{"title":"Heat Signature (video game)","blocks":[{"text":"Heat Signature is an action stealth video game developed and published in 2017 by Suspicious Developments, the studio behind 2013's Gunpoint. The player plays as a mercenary who takes on missions around a procedurally generated galaxy in order to liberate space stations. Heat Signature launched for Microsoft Windows on September 21, 2017."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/e/e1/Heat_Signature.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heat_Signature_(video_game)"},{"title":"Heat","blocks":[{"text":"In thermodynamics, heat is defined as energy in transfer between a body and its surroundings, other than through thermodynamic work or through transfer of matter."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Glowing_metal.jpg/330px-Glowing_metal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heat"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ron_Perlman_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2019.jpg/500px-Ron_Perlman_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Ron_Perlman_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2019.jpg/500px-Ron_Perlman_Photo_Op_GalaxyCon_Raleigh_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content